      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BURN TO FLY (1) has mixed form recently, finishing fifth (25.96) in a Mix at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. GLENREAGH TEARS (2) hit the ground running from out wide and on speed early but faded and swamped late when 7th at this track in Maiden company. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Great chance to atone. CLOSE TALKER (5) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (20.66) in a Maiden at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. HAPPY ALL OVER (7) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
